[[2047,16,8,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The supply to the speedometer module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               reaches\npin 9 of connector A directly from the battery (maxifuse J/B1of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              )\nvia fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ; the supply controlled\nby the ignition (INT) reaches pin 10 of connector A from the line\nprotected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Pin 1 of connector A is earthed.</p><p>The ABS control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends the\nspeedometer signal to pin 11 of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The speedometer signal is sent again from\npin 15 of connector A to the engine control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (JTD\nengines only) and from pin 16 of connector A towards the climate\ncontrol unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p>"],[2047,16,10,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The same signal is sent from pin 14 of connector\nA to the automatic transmission control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M54</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p>"],[2047,16,8,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>Pin 7 of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               receives\nthe signal for the outside temperature from the climate control\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The zeroing signal for the trip meter reaches\npin 12 of connector B from \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               has ideograms lit\nup when the side lights are switched on through the line coming\nfrom the switch for the steering column switch unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              . \n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3233955\">E2530</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The earth signals which provide information\non the state of wear of the brake pads, coming from sensor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K20,</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              reach\npin 11 of connector B.</p><p>On a version available on some markets,\npin 5 of connector B of E10 receives the earth signal from the switch \n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>l45</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , located on the driver&#x27;s seat anchorage, which indicates\nthat the belt is fastened.</p><p>For all the other warning lights, refer\nto the diagrams relating to the components to which they refer.</p><h3>Functional description</h3><p>The water in diesel filter sensor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K31</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is\nsupplied by the line protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F24</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional\nfuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98 A</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , and sends and earth signal to pin 13 of connector\nA of the speedometer module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              when a certain level of humidity is\ndetected in the diesel filter.</p>"]]